## Memory Manager Integration

### Enhanced AdvancedMemoryManager

The memory manager in [src-tauri/src/agent/implementations/memory_manager.rs](mdc:src-tauri/src/agent/implementations/memory_manager.rs) includes:

1. **Visual Configuration**: `visual_config: VisualContextConfig`
2. **Summary Storage**: `visual_summaries: Vec<VisualContextSummary>`
3. **Automatic Processing**: Screenshots processed before storage
4. **Token Estimation**: Proper base64 image token calculation (1 token per 15 chars)

